---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import LegalBody from '../components/LegalBody.astro';
import { site } from '../site.js';
---

<Layout title="Privacy policy" description="How ConVo Neighborhood collects, uses and protects your information.">
  <PageHeader label="Legal" title="Privacy policy" lede="Last updated November 2026." />
  <LegalBody>
    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>We may collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Personal information (name, email, business details)</li>
      <li>Usage data and interaction analytics</li>
      <li>Content submitted through our platforms</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How we use information</h2>
    <p>Your information is used to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Deliver and improve our services</li>
      <li>Communicate updates, support, and opportunities</li>
      <li>Customize your experience within our ecosystem</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Data sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal data. However, we may share information with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Trusted third-party platforms integrated into our ecosystem</li>
      <li>Service providers assisting in operations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Third-party platforms</h2>
    <p>
      As part of our expanding ecosystem, your experience may involve external tools or platforms. These platforms operate
      under their own privacy policies, and we encourage reviewing them.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data security</h2>
    <p>We implement reasonable safeguards to protect your data; however, no system is completely secure.</p>

    <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
    <p>You may:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Request access to your data</li>
      <li>Request corrections or deletion</li>
      <li>Opt out of communications at any time</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Updates to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these Terms and Privacy Policy as our ecosystem evolves. Continued use of our services constitutes
      acceptance of any updates.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions regarding this Privacy Policy, contact the ConVo Neighborhood Support Team at
      <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </LegalBody>
</Layout>
